{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"99262b10f745030c","type":"text","text":"# User Experience\n- 1st priority: AUTOMATION (FOR PAIN POINT)\n\t- Get rid of the thought \"What time to check the tank?\" and go straight to maintaining only when the app warn\n\t- While leaving home, got notice whenever the tank have any failure (equipment, parameters, fish, water level)\n- 2nd priority: FOR (FOR NERDS)\n\t- While leaving home, can see live video of the tank\n\t- If user want to manually check the equipment reading (pH, thermometer, C02)\n\t- sharable livestream of the tank","x":-32,"y":120,"width":672,"height":320},
		{"id":"8a7648c1c89f8ff9","type":"text","text":"## Critical Assumptions\n- Users are really frustrated at checking the tank in person\n- Users are willing to pay\n- Users are willing to place camera near tank","x":17,"y":480,"width":495,"height":160},
		{"id":"e4a710aa0a68b3a8","type":"text","text":"# OceanEyes Technical","x":1694,"y":-29,"width":324,"height":71,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dcdce0506531238a","type":"text","text":"Beta-release Feature's Specification\n--\n- Onboarding screen\n- Analytics\n\t- fish count\n\t- fish spread\n- Remote Livestream, Google login\n- Video crop system\n- Fish Inventory system\n\t- fish species\n\t- calculate parameter range\n\t- calculate appropriate tank size, species compatibility\n- Alert notification system with action steps\n\t- fish drop\n\t- water clarity drop\n\t- parameter out of range\n\t- add water\n- Fish detection\n\t- MaP@50 = 70%\n\t- MaP@50:95 = 50%\n- Species classification\n- Water clarity\n\nAlpha Release Feature's Specification\n--\n- Inventory-aware Species classification\n- pH CO2 measurement\n- thermometer reading\n- fish disease detection\n- Water level detect\n- equipment monitoring\n\t- filter\n\t- bubblers\n\t- light\n\nFuture Consideration\n--\n- OceanEyes Social Platform\n- Daily tank video\n- Tank timelapse\n- Optimize maintenance routine\n- Aquarium Expert AI agent\n- Note system","x":1520,"y":56,"width":672,"height":1170},
		{"id":"8680359420213c12","type":"text","text":"## What problems we're solving?\n- Need to constantly check tank setup in person\n\t- if equipment is working well\n\t\t- filter\n\t\t- bubblers\n\t\t- light\n\t- if fish is healthy\n\t- when to add water\n\t- equipment's readings\n\t\t- thermometer\n\t\t- drop checker\n- No way to see real-time tank remotely and share with friends","x":-600,"y":89,"width":500,"height":411},
		{"id":"b3547b3fc54fc088","type":"text","text":"## MVP product to validate Assumptions\n- P0 features (MVP)\n\t- tank rating system\n\t\t- high score: user no need to worry\n\t\t- low score: user need action\n\t- notice user to action\n\t- remote real-time livestream\n\t- fish detection\n\t- read water clarity (FNU)\n\t- good battery + heat\n- P1 features\n\t- check if equipment is working\n\t- swim heatmap\n\t- fish detection with species\n\t- read drop checker (pH, CO2)\n\t- read thermometer\n\t- note taking\n- P2\n\t- tank recommendation","x":17,"y":712,"width":523,"height":540},
		{"id":"2c4218a524e4fddf","type":"text","text":"## Release and Measure\n- number of waitlist and signup page\n- number of engagement on facebook group\n- number of engagement on reddit\n- number of beta tester\n- feedback page","x":17,"y":1292,"width":495,"height":200},
		{"id":"3d369d1735f07d64","type":"text","text":"## Tweaking\n- Don & Yok opinions\n- feedback system (userjot)\n- reddit comments\n- facebook comments","x":17,"y":1532,"width":495,"height":180},
		{"id":"28b349f7a80ff3af","type":"text","text":"# OceanEyes Experience","x":-60,"y":-15,"width":460,"height":71,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a8382650ffffe461","type":"text","text":"Alpha Per-Screen Specification\n--\n- Onboarding screen\n\t- choosing viewer or monitor\n\t- monitor\n\t\t- video crop -> process all AI model available\n\t\t- user adjust fish inventory\n\t\t- user adjust equipment inventory\n\t\t- final screen\n\t\t- subscription screen\n- Dashboard\n\t- Tank Health Summary (Parameter, Fish, Equipment)\n\t- Tank Summary Info (Showing Fish, Equipment)\n\t- Parameter Summary\n\t- Alerts Summary\n- My Tank\n\t- Fish Species overview card\n\t- Per Fish Species cards\n\t- Fish health cards\n\t- Equipment overview card\n\t- Per Equipment cards\n\t- Equipment health cards\n- Analytics\n\t- Fish Count Overtime Heatmap\n\t- Parameters value Overtime Graph\n\t\t- Clarity\n\t\t- pH\n\t\t- CO2\n\t\t- Temperature\n\t- Fish health Analytics history\n\t- Equipment Analytics history\n- Account\n\t- Google login\n\t- Connect to tank\n\t- Video\n\t\t- streaming quality\n\t\t- color adjust\n\t- AI settings\n\t\t- Frequency\n\t\t\t- Fish detect\n\t\t\t- Equipment Monitoring\n\t\t\t- Fish health Monitoring\n\t\t\t- Clarity detect\n\t\t\t- pH detect\n\t\t\t- Temperature detect\n\t- Notification\n\t\t- frequency\n\t\t\t- low: include all detection \n\t\t\t- medium: include action-needed alert\n\t\t\t- high: only immediate-action alert\n- Each alert screen\n\t- what happened?\n\t- required action","x":1520,"y":1440,"width":672,"height":1484},
		{"id":"415598b03272b078","type":"text","text":"Beta-release Per-Screen Specification\n--\n- Onboarding screen\n\t- choosing viewer or monitor\n\t- monitor\n\t\t- video crop -> process all AI model available\n\t\t- user adjust fish inventory\n\t\t- user adjust equipment inventory\n\t\t- final screen\n\t\t- subscription screen\n- Dashboard\n\t- Tank Health Summary (Parameter, Fish, Equipment)\n\t- Tank Summary Info (Showing Fish, Equipment)\n\t- Parameter Summary\n\t- Alerts Summary\n- My Tank\n\t- Fish Species overview card\n\t- Per Fish Species cards\n\t- Fish health cards\n\t- Equipment overview card\n\t- Per Equipment cards\n\t- Equipment health cards\n- Analytics\n\t- Fish Count Overtime Heatmap\n\t- Parameters value Overtime Graph\n\t\t- Clarity\n\t\t- pH\n\t\t- CO2\n\t\t- Temperature\n\t- Fish health Analytics history\n\t- Equipment Analytics history\n- Account\n\t- Google login\n\t- Connect to tank\n\t- Video\n\t\t- streaming quality\n\t\t- color adjust\n\t- AI settings\n\t\t- Frequency\n\t\t\t- Fish detect\n\t\t\t- Equipment Monitoring\n\t\t\t- Fish health Monitoring\n\t\t\t- Clarity detect\n\t\t\t- pH detect\n\t\t\t- Temperature detect\n\t- Notification\n\t\t- frequency\n\t\t\t- low: include all detection \n\t\t\t- medium: include action-needed alert\n\t\t\t- high: only immediate-action alert\n- Each alert screen\n\t- what happened?\n\t- required action","x":920,"y":21,"width":480,"height":1484},
		{"id":"2330832a7b83c50d","type":"text","text":"## Feature's Tech stack\n- Base model\n\t- Segment the area of the fish tank\n- drop check -> Co2, pH\n\t- Detect color the drop checker\n\t- Detect the position of the drop checker\n\t- Convert Color to Co2 & pH\n- water clarity\n\t- classify the clarity value of the water\n- thermometer read\n\t- UNKNOWN\n- equipment monitor **\n\t- Detect the location of the equipment\n\t- Classify if the equipment working correctly\n- water level **\n\t- Detect the water level\n- fish health read\n\t- Detect the location of each fish\n\t- Classify the species of each fish\n\t- Classify the disease of detected fish","x":2270,"y":61,"width":420,"height":580},
