		{"id":"3e64437b97cbfb55","type":"text","text":"## Feature's Tech stack\n- Base model\n\t- Segment the area of the fish tank\n- drop check -> Co2, pH\n\t- Detect color the drop checker\n\t- Detect the position of the drop checker\n\t- Convert Color to Co2 & pH\n- water clarity\n\t- classify the clarity value of the water\n- thermometer read\n\t- UNKNOWN\n- equipment monitor **\n\t- Detect the location of the equipment\n\t- Classify if the equipment working correctly\n- water level **\n\t- Detect the water level\n- fish health read\n\t- Detect the location of each fish\n\t- Classify the species of each fish\n\t- Classify the disease of detected fish","x":4265,"y":520,"width":420,"height":580},
